<p>Pre-qualification through a soft credit pull lets you compare several real offers before committing to any single hard inquiry, and applying to multiple lenders within a short window — typically 14 to 45 days depending on the scoring model — counts as a single inquiry for credit-scoring purposes, removing the usual penalty for shopping around.</p>
